<Shell title="About" section="about">
  <div class="wrap narrow-page">
    <header class="about-lead"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT</span><h1>Hello, I'm<br/><span class="accent">Changjin Han.</span></h1><p>I've worked on speech synthesis and audio deepfake detection. I started this blog to keep track of papers I read. Lately, I've also been reading about AI agents and bond markets.</p></header>
    <section class="about-block"><h2>What I write about</h2><p>I write down what I learn from speech AI papers. Over time, my interests have grown to include agents and financial markets.</p><p>Bondnote collects papers, institutional research, and industry writing on AI and the bond market, organized by date.</p></section>
    <section class="about-block"><h2>Research</h2><p>I've studied and experimented with speech synthesis, pronunciation modeling, and audio deepfake detection. My ICASSP and AAAI papers and seminar slides are on the <a href="/publications/">research page</a>.</p></section>
    <section class="about-block"><h2>Why I write</h2><p>If I only read something, I tend to forget it. These notes are what I understood at the time, written so I can find my way back to the work later.</p></section>
    <section class="about-block"><h2>Find me elsewhere</h2><div class="about-links"><a href="mailto:cjhanist@gmail.com">Email ↗</a><a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DJxXspAAAAAJ&hl=en">Google Scholar ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/ChangjinHan">GitHub ↗</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/changjin-han-a907b520a/">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href="https://x.com/cjhanist">X ↗</a></div></section>
